        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana DC10, Barrier Free Door Closer</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nFor doors weighing 55 to 165 pounds, Deltana's Heavy Duty Door closer is for universal applications. Barrier free, meets handicap ADA requirements and is UL rated for a 3 hour fire door. An ANSI grade 1 door closer, it comes packaged with parallel bracket, sex bolts, and a cast aluminum body. The dual valve means that it has adjustable closing and latching speeds. Available in 3 different finish colors.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<table width=\"100\" align=\"right\">\r\n<tr>\r\n<td>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</td>\r\n</tr>\r\n</table>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Barrier Free Door Closer:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable closing speed.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latching speed.</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable backcheck.</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with parallel bracket, sex bolts, and a cast aluminum body.</li>\r\n<li>Factory Tested to Exceed ANSI A 156.4 Grade 1</li>\r\n<li>UL 10C Fire Rated for 3 hours. R27405 UL LISTED 47V5</li>\r\n<li>Non-handed, reversible for both left and right hand doors.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a>: Barrier Free meets ANSI A 117.1 requirements.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the DC10 Door Closer:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>For Door Weight: 55 - 165 LBS</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Height: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Closer Body Length: 9-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Horizontal Mounting Holes: 9-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Vertical Mounting Holes: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Spring Size: Adjustable 1-4</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-DC1050.pdf?v=1691095382\" target=\"new\"><b>DEL-DC10 Door Closer Specifications Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><b><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DC10-install.pdf?v=1691095323\" target=\"new\">Deltana DC10 Installation Instructions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
